  "notes": "USAGE:\n- たっぷり + verb: generously, plenty (adverb)\n- たっぷり⟦の→の：09472_no⟧ + noun: plenty of, ample (adjectival)\n- 〜がたっぷり⟦ある→ある：00006_aru⟧: there is plenty of ~\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- たっぷり⟦{食|た}べる→食べる：00396_taberu⟧ (to eat plenty)\n- たっぷり⟦{寝|ね}る→寝る：00470_neru⟧ (to sleep plenty)\n- たっぷり⟦{使|つか}う→使う：00473_tsukau⟧ (to use generously)\n- たっぷり⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦{野菜|やさい}→野菜：02265_yasai⟧ (plenty of vegetables)\n\nNUANCE: Conveys a sense of satisfaction and abundance. Often used when describing generous portions of food or having enough time/resources.",
